@startuml
[*] --> Inserted : Card insertion
Inserted --> PIN_Entered : Prompt user to enter PIN
PIN_Entered --> PIN_Validated : Verify entered PIN against stored information
PIN_Validated --> Options_Provided : Provide options to user
Options_Provided --> Transaction_Completed : User approval for withdrawal request and cash dispensing
Transaction_Completed --> Card_Returned : Return user's card
Card_Returned --> [*] : Reset system after brief moment

@enduml
